msgstr "Modificări majore {#major-changes}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Import {#import}"
msgstr "Import {#import}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For backward compatibility, you must explicity import the V2 primitives. "
"Specifying `import <primitive>V2 as <primitive>` is not required, but makes "
"it easier to transition code to V2.\n"
msgstr ""
"Din motive de compatibilitate retroactivă, trebuie să imporți explicit "
"primitivele V2. Specificarea `import <primitive>V2 as <primitive>` nu este "
"obligatorie, dar face mai ușoară tranziția codului la V2.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"After the V1 primitives are no longer supported, `import <primitive>` will import the V2 version of the specified primitive.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"După ce primitivele V1 nu mai sunt suportate, `import <primitive>` va importa versiunea V2 a primitivei specificate.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

