#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"error-mit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"error-mit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Error mitigation and suppression {#error-mitigation-and-suppression}"
msgstr "Atenuarea și suprimarea erorilor {#error-mitigation-and-suppression}"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because Sampler V2 returns samples without postprocessing, it does not "
"support resilience levels.\n"
msgstr ""
"Deoarece Sampler V2 returnează eșantioane fără postprocesare, nu acceptă "
"niveluri de reziliență.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler V2 does not support `optimization_level`.\n"
msgstr "Sampler V2 nu acceptă `optimization_level`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Estimator V2 will drop support for `optimization_level` on or around 30 "
"September 2024.\n"
msgstr ""
"Estimator V2 va renunța la suportul pentru `optimization_level` în jurul "
"datei de 30 septembrie 2024.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Estimator V2 does not support resilience level 3.  This is because "
"resilience level 3 in V1 Estimator uses Probabilistic Error Cancellation "
"(PEC), which is proven to give unbiased results at the cost of exponential "
"processing time. Level 3 was removed to draw attention to that tradeoff. You"
" can, however, still use PEC as the error mitigation method by specifying "
"the `pec_mitigation` option.\n"
msgstr ""
"Estimator V2 nu acceptă nivelul de reziliență 3. Acest lucru se datorează "
"faptului că nivelul 3 în Estimator V1 folosește Probabilistic Error "
"Cancellation (PEC), despre care s-a demonstrat că oferă rezultate nebiasate "
"cu costul unui timp de procesare exponențial. Nivelul 3 a fost eliminat "
"pentru a atrage atenția asupra acestui compromis. Poți folosi în continuare "
"PEC ca metodă de atenuare a erorilor, specificând opțiunea "
"`pec_mitigation`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Estimator V2 supports `resilience_level` 0-2, as described in the following "
"table.  These options are more advanced than their V1 counterparts. You can "
"also explicitly turn on / off individual error mitigation / suppression "
"methods.\n"
msgstr ""
"Estimator V2 acceptă `resilience_level` 0-2, conform tabelului următor. "
"Aceste opțiuni sunt mai avansate decât echivalentele lor din V1. De "
"asemenea, poți activa/dezactiva explicit metode individuale de "
"atenuare/suprimare a erorilor.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    | Level 1                   | Level 2                   |\n"
"    |---------------------------|---------------------------|\n"
"    | Measurement twirling      | Measurement twirling      |\n"
"    | Readout error mitigation  | Readout error mitigation  |\n"
"    |                           | ZNE                       |\n"
msgstr ""
"    | Nivel 1                        | Nivel 2                        |\n"
"    |--------------------------------|--------------------------------|\n"
"    | Measurement twirling           | Measurement twirling           |\n"
"    | Readout error mitigation       | Readout error mitigation       |\n"
"    |                                | ZNE                            |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "estimator = Estimator(backend)\n"
msgstr "estimator = Estimator(backend)\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set resilience_level to 0"
msgstr "Set resilience_level to 0"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "estimator.options.resilience_level = 0\n"
msgstr "estimator.options.resilience_level = 0\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Turn on measurement error mitigation"
msgstr "Turn on measurement error mitigation"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "estimator.options.resilience.measure_mitigation = True\n"
msgstr "estimator.options.resilience.measure_mitigation = True\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "sampler = Sampler(backend)\n"
msgstr "sampler = Sampler(backend)\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Turn on dynamical decoupling with sequence XpXm."
msgstr "Turn on dynamical decoupling with sequence XpXm."

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sampler.options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True\n"
"sampler.options.dynamical_decoupling.sequence_type = \"XpXm\"\n"
msgstr ""
"sampler.options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True\n"
"sampler.options.dynamical_decoupling.sequence_type = \"XpXm\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"print(f\">> dynamical decoupling sequence to use: \"\n"
"f\"{sampler.options.dynamical_decoupling.sequence_type}\")\n"
msgstr ""
"print(f\">> dynamical decoupling sequence to use: \"\n"
"f\"{sampler.options.dynamical_decoupling.sequence_type}\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"transpilation\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"transpilation\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation {#transpilation}"
msgstr "Transpilare {#transpilation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"V2 primitives support only circuits that adhere to the Instruction Set "
"Architecture (ISA) of a particular backend. Because the primitives do not "
"perform layout, routing, and translation operations, the corresponding "
"transpilation options from V1 are not supported.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primitivele V2 acceptă doar circuite care respectă Instruction Set "
"Architecture (ISA) a unui backend specific. Deoarece primitivele nu "
"efectuează operații de layout, rutare și traducere, opțiunile de transpilare"
" corespunzătoare din V1 nu sunt acceptate.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Job status {#job-status}"
msgstr "Starea job-ului {#job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The V2 primitives have a new `RuntimeJobV2` class, which inherits from "
"`BasePrimitiveJob`. The `status()` method of this new class returns a string"
" instead of a JobStatus enum from Qiskit. See the [RuntimeJobV2 API "
"reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/runtime-"
"job-v2) for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primitivele V2 au o nouă clasă `RuntimeJobV2`, care moștenește din "
"`BasePrimitiveJob`. Metoda `status()` a acestei noi clase returnează un șir "
"de caractere în loc de o enumerare JobStatus din Qiskit. Consultă [referința"
" API RuntimeJobV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/runtime-job-v2) pentru detalii.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"V2\" label=\"V2 primitives\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"V2\" label=\"V2 primitives\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  <TabItem value=\"V1\" label=\"V1 primitives\">\n"
msgstr "  <TabItem value=\"V1\" label=\"V1 primitives\">\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Steps to migrate to Estimator V2 {#steps-to-migrate-to-estimator-v2}"
msgstr ""
"Pași pentru migrarea la Estimator V2 {#steps-to-migrate-to-estimator-v2}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Replace `from qiskit_ibm_runtime import Estimator` with `from "
"qiskit_ibm_runtime import EstimatorV2 as Estimator`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Înlocuiește `from qiskit_ibm_runtime import Estimator` cu `from "
"qiskit_ibm_runtime import EstimatorV2 as Estimator`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Remove any `from qiskit_ibm_runtime import Options` statements, since the "
"`Options` class is not used by V2 primitives. You can instead pass options "
"as a dictionary when initializing the `EstimatorV2` class (for example "
"`estimator = Estimator(backend, options={“dynamical_decoupling”: {“enable”: "
"True}})`), or set them after initialization:\n"
msgstr ""
"Elimină toate instrucțiunile `from qiskit_ibm_runtime import Options`, "
"deoarece clasa `Options` nu este folosită de primitivele V2. În schimb, poți"
" transmite opțiunile ca un dicționar la inițializarea clasei `EstimatorV2` "
"(de exemplu, `estimator = Estimator(backend, "
"options={\"dynamical_decoupling\": {\"enable\": True}})`), sau le poți seta "
"după inițializare:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: msgid repeated on page, first translation kept
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Review all the [supported options](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/options) and make updates accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Revizuiește toate [opțiunile "
"acceptate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options) și "
"efectuează actualizările necesare.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Group each circuit you want to run with the observables and parameter values"
" you want to apply to the circuit in a tuple (a PUB). For example, use "
"`(circuit1, observable1, parameter_set1)` if you want to run `circuit1` with"
" `observable1` and `parameter_set1`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Grupează fiecare circuit pe care vrei să-l rulezi împreună cu observabilele "
"și valorile parametrilor pe care vrei să le aplici circuitului, într-un "
"tuplu (un PUB). De exemplu, folosește `(circuit1, observable1, "
"parameter_set1)` dacă vrei să rulezi `circuit1` cu `observable1` și "
"`parameter_set1`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You might need to reshape your arrays of observables or parameter sets if "
"you want to apply their outer product. For example, an array of observables "
"of shape (4, 1) and an array of parameter sets of shape (1, 6) will give you"
" a result of (4, 6) expectation values. See the [Numpy broadcasting "
"rules](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/basics.broadcasting.html) for more "
"details.\n"
msgstr ""
"S-ar putea să fie nevoie să remodelezi tablourile de observabile sau de "
"seturi de parametri dacă vrei să aplici produsul lor exterior. De exemplu, "
"un tablou de observabile de forma (4, 1) și un tablou de seturi de parametri"
" de forma (1, 6) îți vor oferi un rezultat de (4, 6) valori așteptate. "
"Consultă [regulile de broadcasting "
"Numpy](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/basics.broadcasting.html) pentru "
"mai multe detalii.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can optionally specify the precision you want for that specific PUB.\n"
msgstr "Poți specifica opțional precizia dorită pentru acel PUB specific.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. Update Estimator's `run()` method to pass in the list of PUBs. For example, `run([(circuit1, observable1, parameter_set1)])`.\n"
"  You can optionally specify a `precision` here, which would apply to all PUBs.\n"
"6. Estimator V2 job results are grouped by PUBs. You can see the expectation value and standard error for each PUB by indexing to it. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"5. Actualizează metoda `run()` a Estimator pentru a transmite lista de PUB-uri. De exemplu, `run([(circuit1, observable1, parameter_set1)])`.\n"
"  Poți specifica opțional o valoare `precision` aici, care s-ar aplica tuturor PUB-urilor.\n"
"6. Rezultatele job-urilor Estimator V2 sunt grupate pe PUB-uri. Poți vedea valoarea așteptată și eroarea standard pentru fiecare PUB indexând la acesta. De exemplu:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Estimator full examples {#estimator-full-examples}"
msgstr "Exemple complete cu Estimator {#estimator-full-examples}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run a single experiment {#run-a-single-experiment}"
msgstr "Rulează un singur experiment {#run-a-single-experiment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Estimator to determine the expectation value of a single circuit-"
"observable pair.\n"
msgstr ""
"Folosește Estimator pentru a determina valoarea de așteptare a unei singure "
"perechi circuit-observabil.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"import numpy as np\n"
"from qiskit.circuit.library import IQP\n"
"from qiskit.quantum_info import SparsePauliOp, random_hermitian\n"
"from qiskit_ibm_runtime import EstimatorV2 as Estimator, QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"import numpy as np\n"
"from qiskit.circuit.library import IQP\n"
"from qiskit.quantum_info import SparsePauliOp, random_hermitian\n"
"from qiskit_ibm_runtime import EstimatorV2 as Estimator, QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"backend = service.least_busy(operational=True, \n"
"  simulator=False, min_num_qubits=127)\n"
"estimator = Estimator(backend)\n"
msgstr ""
"service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"backend = service.least_busy(operational=True, \n"
"  simulator=False, min_num_qubits=127)\n"
"estimator = Estimator(backend)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "n_qubits = 127\n"
msgstr "n_qubits = 127\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mat = np.real(random_hermitian(n_qubits, seed=1234))\n"
"circuit = IQP(mat)\n"
"observable = SparsePauliOp(\"Z\" * n_qubits)\n"
msgstr ""
"mat = np.real(random_hermitian(n_qubits, seed=1234))\n"
"circuit = IQP(mat)\n"
"observable = SparsePauliOp(\"Z\" * n_qubits)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(optimization_level=1, backend=backend)\n"
"isa_circuit = pm.run(circuit)\n"
"isa_observable = observable.apply_layout(isa_circuit.layout)\n"
msgstr ""
"pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(optimization_level=1, backend=backend)\n"
"isa_circuit = pm.run(circuit)\n"
"isa_observable = observable.apply_layout(isa_circuit.layout)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"job = estimator.run([(isa_circuit, isa_observable)])\n"
"result = job.result()\n"
msgstr ""
"job = estimator.run([(isa_circuit, isa_observable)])\n"
"result = job.result()\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"print(f\" > Expectation value: {result[0].data.evs}\")\n"
"print(f\" > Metadata: {result[0].metadata}\")\n"
msgstr ""
"print(f\" > Expectation value: {result[0].data.evs}\")\n"
"print(f\" > Metadata: {result[0].metadata}\")\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run multiple experiments in a single job {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-"
"single-job}"
msgstr ""
"Rulează mai multe experimente într-un singur job {#run-multiple-experiments-"
"in-a-single-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Estimator to determine the expectation values of multiple circuit-"
